<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFramework>net10.0</TargetFramework>
    <PackageId>STAF.UI.API</PackageId>
    <Authors>Sooraj Ramachandran</Authors>
    <Product>STAF</Product>
    <Description>A Test Automation Framework for CSharp Selenium-based UI and API testing, featuring built-in reporting capabilities with MCP Agent Support.</Description>
    <Copyright></Copyright>
    <AssemblyName>STAF</AssemblyName>
    <RootNamespace>STAF</RootNamespace>
    <NeutralLanguage>en-US</NeutralLanguage>
    <PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>false</PackageRequireLicenseAcceptance>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
    <PackageTags>Selenium, Framework, API, UI Tests, API Tests, Excel</PackageTags>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>STAF.UI.API 4.4.5 targets .NET 10. Projects consuming this package must use .NET 10 or above. The public API is unchanged.

Dependency updates (previous → current):
- Selenium.WebDriver and Selenium.Support 4.49.0 → 4.52.0
- MSTest.TestFramework 4.4.1 → 4.5.2
- Microsoft.Data.SqlClient 7.1.0 → 7.1.1
- Deque.AxeCore.Selenium 4.13.0 → 4.14.0
- Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json 10.0.12 → 10.0.14
- System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs is now a direct reference at 10.0.14, replacing the vulnerable 9.0.18 build pulled in by Microsoft.Data.SqlClient (GHSA-846f-f764-76mx, GHSA-2fmv-rv2c-59x7)
- ClosedXML remains 0.105.1 (already the latest stable release)

Test projects that pin MSTest.TestFramework or MSTest.TestAdapter must move both to 4.5.2 or later. An older pin fails restore with NU1605.

UI and API test framework for Selenium.
Supports Chrome, Edge, and remote drivers.
Supports parallel execution and is thread safe.
Sample project and MCP server: https://github.com/sooraj171/STAF.Selenium.Tests
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/sooraj171/STAF.Selenium.Tests</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageIcon>staf.png</PackageIcon>
    <PackageIconUrl />
    <Version>4.4.5</Version>
    <AssemblyVersion>4.4.5.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>4.4.5.0</FileVersion>
    <RepositoryType />
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.md</PackageReadmeFile>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)' == 'Release'">
    <PackageOutputPath>$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\bin\</PackageOutputPath>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Remove="test - Copy11.png" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <Content Include="appsettings.json">
      <CopyToOutputDirectory>Always</CopyToOutputDirectory>
    </Content>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\.editorconfig" Link=".editorconfig" />
    <None Include="..\README.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="ClosedXML" Version="0.105.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Deque.AxeCore.Selenium" Version="4.14.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Data.SqlClient" Version="7.1.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Extensions.Configuration.Json" Version="10.0.14" />
    <PackageReference Include="MSTest.TestFramework" Version="4.5.2" />
    <PackageReference Include="Selenium.Support" Version="4.52.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="Selenium.WebDriver" Version="4.52.0" />
    <PackageReference Include="System.Security.Cryptography.Pkcs" Version="10.0.14" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <None Update="staf.png">
      <CopyToOutputDirectory>PreserveNewest</CopyToOutputDirectory>
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
